  <ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered id="Tag1258" contextRef="C1">Respondent is engaged in open-access transportation of natural gas. Respondent's pipeline system originates in the state of Arizona and extends to the vicinity of Bakersfield, California. Respondent delivers all of its natural gas into the state of California.</ferc:GeneralInformationAboutStatesInWhichRespondentServicesWereRendered>
