          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">Mojave Pipeline Operating Company, L.L.C. provides administrative and operational support for us. The methods of allocating these costs are through direct assignment and the modified Massachusetts Formula (based on labor, plant, and operating income).<xhtml:span style="mso-spacerun: yes;"></xhtml:span>See Page 122.1 "Notes to Financial Statements," Note 5 "Related Party Transactions" for additional information.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
